summary:
The 24th International Asset, Facility and Maintenance Management Conference (OMAINTEC 2027) will take place from 17–19 January 2027 at The Ritz-Carlton, Jeddah, Saudi Arabia, under the theme “Empowering the Integration of Digital Transformation and Artificial Intelligence - Towards Smart Asset and Facility Management.” 
The conference is organized by the Saudi Asset, Facility and Maintenance Management Association (SAFMMA), in collaboration with the Arab Asset, Facility and Maintenance Management Council.
The conference aims to enhance operational efficiency, sustainability, and asset performance by promoting artificial intelligence, digital transformation, innovative technologies, knowledge exchange, international best practices, and professional development.
OMAINTEC 2027 features eight key tracks: 
Electrical and Energy Systems; 
Roads and Transportation Systems;
Maintenance Systems Management; 
Water Systems; 
Buildings and Facilities Management; 
Communications, 
Smart Maintenance and Cybersecurity; 
Education, Training and Leadership, 
Governance and Strategy in Asset Management.
Bringing together international decision-makers, industry leaders, researchers, and professionals, the conference offers technical sessions, specialized workshops, panel discussions, and global case studies. It also features FAM Expo 2027, showcasing innovative technologies and solutions while fostering strategic partnerships, business opportunities, and collaboration to shape a smarter, more sustainable future for asset, facility and maintenance management.
